and are made available to the public.\nThe Murray County Recorder’s Office does not perform abstracting services. Any assistance our office provides in obtaining copies of recorded documents is for courtesy/reference purposes only and does not carry any warranties or fitness for particular use.\nPer Minnesota Statute 481.02, Murray County Recorder’s Office does not provide legal advice or assistance in document preparation. We strongly encourage you to consult with a real estate attorney and/or title company if you require assistance.\nKaren Brown , County Recorder 507-836-1161\nNicola Backer , Deputy Recorder 507-836-1162\nMailing Information :\nMurray County Recorder\n2500 28th Street\nP.O. Box 57\nSlayton, MN 56172-0057\nShare this page\nShare this page\n-->\nClose\nPowered by , the Government Website Experts. | Login\nOriginal text\nRate this translation\nYour feedback will be used to help improve Google Translate\nClose Read More",
